OL,3,CCorrespondence with TV presenter Nick
OL,4,COwen
OL,5,
OL,6,FA full profile for TV presenter Nick
OL,7,FOwen can be found on The TV Room's
OL,8,FShowreel website.
OL,10,FPaul R. Jackson corresponded with Nick
OL,11,Fin August 2025, about his long
OL,12,Fbroadcasting career.
OL,23,EPub: 10-Jan-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BShowreel  CRewind FNat Radio
FL,146,140,120,200,0,100
PN,14502
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F145A1786056662
OL,1,W~s1z5~k4j5jw=hw1~sj5           G2/21
OL,2,W,.!/*%+.!+.-'*%/"-$+,"-$U,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,CCorrespondence with TV presenter Nick
OL,4,COwen
OL,5,
OL,6,GHAD YOU ALWAYS WANTED TO GET INTO
OL,7,GBROADCASTING? WHAT PROMPTED YOUR MOVE
OL,8,GTO BBC RADIO BIRMINGHAM?
OL,10,F"Broadcasting never crossed my mind. My
OL,11,Fambition was Fleet Street, but I got
OL,12,Fdiverted by the advent of BBC local
OL,13,Fradio.
OL,15,F"While working in Birmingham, I kept
OL,16,Fmeeting reporters from the newish BBC
OL,17,FRadio Birmingham and they tempted me to
OL,18,Fapply for a job.
OL,20,F"After two failed attempts to join the
OL,21,FBBC, I finally made it in late 1973.
OL,23,EPub: 10-Jan-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BShowreel  CRewind FNat Radio
FL,146,140,120,200,0,100
PN,14503
SC,0003
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F145A1786056662
OL,1,W~s1z5~k4j5jw=hw1~sj5           G3/21
OL,2,W,.!/*%+.!+.-'*%/"-$+,"-$U,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,CCorrespondence with TV presenter Nick
OL,4,COwen
OL,5,
OL,6,GWAS IT AN EASY TRANSITION TO MAKE FROM
OL,7,GRADIO TO TV ` AND DID YOU TAKE TO IT
OL,8,GEASILY?
OL,10,F"After five years producing, presenting
OL,11,Fand reporting for local radio, I was a
OL,12,Flittle dubious when I was approached to
OL,13,Ftry TV, but I like to feel I settled in
OL,14,Fquite quickly."
OL,23,EPub: 10-Jan-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BShowreel  CRewind FNat Radio
FL,146,140,120,200,0,100
PN,14504
SC,0004
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F145A1786056662
OL,1,W~s1z5~k4j5jw=hw1~sj5           G4/21
OL,2,W,.!/*%+.!+.-'*%/"-$+,"-$U,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,CCorrespondence with TV presenter Nick
OL,4,COwen
OL,5,
OL,6,GWHAT ARE YOUR MEMORIES OF WORKING AT
OL,7,GTHE OLD PEBBLE MILL STUDIOS AND DID
OL,8,GYOU BUMP INTO ANY OF THE CELEBRITIES
OL,9,GTHAT APPEARED ON PEBBLE MILL AT ONE?
OL,11,F"Yes, there was always a buzz about
OL,12,FPebble Mill because so much was being
OL,13,Fproduced there both on radio and
OL,14,Ftelevision. You often bumped into mega
OL,15,Fcelebs in the corridor.
OL,17,F"Of course, nearly 20 years later those
OL,18,Fmega celebs were appearing on our own
OL,19,Fprogramme Good Morning with Anne and
OL,20,FNick, which itself came from the
OL,21,Ffoyer."
OL,23,EPub: 10-Jan-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BShowreel  CRewind FNat Radio
FL,146,140,120,200,0,100
PN,14505
SC,0005
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F145A1786056662
OL,1,W~s1z5~k4j5jw=hw1~sj5           G5/21
OL,2,W,.!/*%+.!+.-'*%/"-$+,"-$U,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,CCorrespondence with TV presenter Nick
OL,4,COwen
OL,5,
OL,6,GWHO WERE YOUR COLLEAGUES ON ATV TODAY
OL,7,GAND WAS BOB THE MAIN PRESENTER? WHEN
OL,8,GDID YOU FIRST MEET AND WORK WITH ANNE
OL,9,GDIAMOND ` WAS IT DURING THIS PERIOD?
OL,11,F"The main presenter on ATV when I
OL,12,Fstarted was Derek Hobson, later
OL,13,Ffollowed by Bob Warman. Loads of great
OL,14,Fcolleagues at ATV, including Chris
OL,15,FTarrant who I still see socially today
OL,16,Fand Anne Diamond.
OL,18,F"Anne and I became great friends during
OL,19,Fthose ATV/Central days, especially
OL,20,Fafter we were picked out to be the
OL,21,Flaunch presenters of Central News East.
OL,23,EPub: 10-Jan-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BShowreel  CRewind FNat Radio
FL,146,140,120,200,0,100
PN,14506
SC,0006
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F145A1786056662
OL,1,W~s1z5~k4j5jw=hw1~sj5           G6/21
OL,2,W,.!/*%+.!+.-'*%/"-$+,"-$U,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,CCorrespondence with TV presenter Nick
OL,4,COwen
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Even though the show never got off the
OL,7,Fground because of the industrial
OL,8,Fdispute, we worked together on loads of
OL,9,Fpilot shows in Nottingham and then had
OL,10,Fto go back to Birmingham to share
OL,11,Fpresenting duties with Bob and Wendy
OL,12,FNelson."
OL,23,EPub: 10-Jan-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BShowreel  CRewind FNat Radio
FL,146,140,120,200,0,100
PN,14507
SC,0007
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F145A1786056662
OL,1,W~s1z5~k4j5jw=hw1~sj5           G7/21
OL,2,W,.!/*%+.!+.-'*%/"-$+,"-$U,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,CCorrespondence with TV presenter Nick
OL,4,COwen
OL,5,
OL,6,GWAS 1980 YOUR FIRST TIME WORKING FOR
OL,7,GITV SPORT?
OL,9,F"After I joined ATV, mainly to cover
OL,10,Fsport in 1978, I often contributed to
OL,11,FITV Sport network, mostly for On the
OL,12,FBall.
OL,14,F"I became more involved in 1980 with
OL,15,Fthe European Championships and then, of
OL,16,Fcourse, commentating and reporting for
OL,17,Fthe World Cup in 1982."
OL,23,EPub: 10-Jan-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BShowreel  CRewind FNat Radio
FL,146,140,120,200,0,100
PN,14508
SC,0008
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F145A1786056662
OL,1,W~s1z5~k4j5jw=hw1~sj5           G8/21
OL,2,W,.!/*%+.!+.-'*%/"-$+,"-$U,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,CCorrespondence with TV presenter Nick
OL,4,COwen
OL,5,
OL,6,GHOW DID YOU GET TO WORK ON BULLSEYE
OL,7,GAND WERE YOU IN THE STUDIO FOR THE
OL,8,GRECORDINGS OR DID YOU DO IT LATER IN A
OL,9,GVOICE BOOTH?
OL,11,F"It was still coming from Birmingham
OL,12,Fwhen they asked me to do the
OL,13,Fvoiceovers.
OL,15,F"I suppose I was readily available
OL,16,Fvoice at the time, living locally and
OL,17,Fobviously knew all the production team
OL,18,Freally well, as we all worked together
OL,19,Fon other programmes at ATV and later
OL,20,FCentral."
OL,23,EPub: 10-Jan-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BShowreel  CRewind FNat Radio
FL,146,140,120,200,0,100
PN,14509
SC,0009
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F145A1786056662
OL,1,W~s1z5~k4j5jw=hw1~sj5           G9/21
OL,2,W,.!/*%+.!+.-'*%/"-$+,"-$U,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,CCorrespondence with TV presenter Nick
OL,4,COwen
OL,5,
OL,6,GWHAT ARE YOUR MEMORIES OF THE ABORTED
OL,7,GLAUNCH OF CENTRAL NEWS EAST IN
OL,8,GNOTTINGHAM? WHEN DID YOU LEAVE
OL,9,GCENTRAL?
OL,11,F"Anne and I did appear regularly
OL,12,Ftogether from Birmingham as Central had
OL,13,Fto cover both east and west regions for
OL,14,Fthe time being.
OL,16,F"That is when I realised we had a great
OL,17,Fpartnership going, developed a strong
OL,18,Ffriendship and that took off on
OL,19,Fnational TV, not long afterwards with
OL,20,FTV-am.
OL,23,EPub: 10-Jan-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BShowreel  CRewind FNat Radio
FL,146,140,120,200,0,100
PN,14510
SC,0010
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F145A1786056662
OL,1,W~s1z5~k4j5jw=hw1~sj5          G10/21
OL,2,W,.!/*%+.!+.-'*%/"-$+,"-$U,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,CCorrespondence with TV presenter Nick
OL,4,COwen
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The aborted launch of Central News
OL,7,FEast was so disappointing. Anne and I
OL,8,Fplus all the production staff had
OL,9,Fworked so hard to start up the new
OL,10,Fstation.
OL,12,F"The plug was only pulled within an
OL,13,Fhour or so of going on air, from what I
OL,14,Fremember. The studios were packed with
OL,15,Fdignitaries.
OL,17,F"I left Central at the end of 1982 and
OL,18,Fjoined TV-am at the beginning of
OL,19,FJanuary 1983."
OL,23,EPub: 10-Jan-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BShowreel  CRewind FNat Radio
FL,146,140,120,200,0,100
PN,14511
SC,0011
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F145A1786056662
OL,1,W~s1z5~k4j5jw=hw1~sj5          G11/21
OL,2,W,.!/*%+.!+.-'*%/"-$+,"-$U,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,CCorrespondence with TV presenter Nick
OL,4,COwen
OL,5,
OL,6,GWHAT ARE YOUR MEMORIES OF WORKING FOR
OL,7,GTV-AM IN CAMDEN LOCK? ANYONE YOU
OL,8,GINTERVIEWED THAT STOOD OUT ` OR
OL,9,GSOMEONE YOU ALWAYS WANTED TO MEET OR
OL,10,GWHOSE CAREER YOU ENJOYED?
OL,12,F"I absolutely loved everything about
OL,13,FCamden Lock. Fabulous colleagues,
OL,14,Ffriendships forged in the white heat of
OL,15,Fderision from the wider world as we
OL,16,Ftried to pioneer a new concept in the
OL,17,FUK.
OL,19,F"After all the close calls when the
OL,20,Fstation nearly folded, proud to say it
OL,21,Fbecame hugely successful.
OL,23,EPub: 10-Jan-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BShowreel  CRewind FNat Radio
FL,146,140,120,200,0,100
PN,14512
SC,0012
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F145A1786056662
OL,1,W~s1z5~k4j5jw=hw1~sj5          G12/21
OL,2,W,.!/*%+.!+.-'*%/"-$+,"-$U,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,CCorrespondence with TV presenter Nick
OL,4,COwen
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I can hardly mention all the
OL,7,Foutstanding people I have met and
OL,8,Finterviewed.
OL,10,F"Eight past or present PMs for a start.
OL,11,FPop stars from the Beatles to the Bee
OL,12,FGees to the Everly Brothers to the
OL,13,FKinks, the Animals, Genesis, Wham, Tom
OL,14,FJones, Elton John. I could go on!
OL,16,F"Sporting legends too from athletics,
OL,17,Fcricket, boxing, football and many
OL,18,Fbecame great friends.
OL,20,F"My favourite was Eric Morecambe, my
OL,21,Fall-time hero.
OL,23,EPub: 10-Jan-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BShowreel  CRewind FNat Radio
FL,146,140,120,200,0,100
PN,14513
SC,0013
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F145A1786056662
OL,1,W~s1z5~k4j5jw=hw1~sj5          G13/21
OL,2,W,.!/*%+.!+.-'*%/"-$+,"-$U,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,CCorrespondence with TV presenter Nick
OL,4,COwen
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Bob Hope in his back garden in LA,
OL,7,FJane Fonda, Bette Midler ` fantastic
OL,8,Fmemories.
OL,10,F"Of course, we interviewed loads of
OL,11,Fgreat names too on Good Morning with
OL,12,FAnne and Nick in the 1990s on BBC One.
OL,14,F"I feel very fortunate."
OL,23,EPub: 10-Jan-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BShowreel  CRewind FNat Radio
FL,146,140,120,200,0,100
PN,14514
SC,0014
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F145A1786056662
OL,1,W~s1z5~k4j5jw=hw1~sj5          G14/21
OL,2,W,.!/*%+.!+.-'*%/"-$+,"-$U,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,CCorrespondence with TV presenter Nick
OL,4,COwen
OL,5,
OL,6,GWHO ARE YOUR SPORTING ICONS ` THAT YOU
OL,7,GMET AND INTERVIEWED?
OL,9,F"I have interviewed Maradona, Bobby
OL,10,FMoore, Bobby and Jack Charlton, Geoff
OL,11,FHurst, Gordon Banks, Jimmy Greaves,
OL,12,FBrian Clough and many many more.
OL,14,F"My panel for the World Cup semi-final
OL,15,Fin 1990 was Greaves, Hurst, Banks."
OL,23,EPub: 10-Jan-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BShowreel  CRewind FNat Radio
FL,146,140,120,200,0,100
PN,14515
SC,0015
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F145A1786056662
OL,1,W~s1z5~k4j5jw=hw1~sj5          G15/21
OL,2,W,.!/*%+.!+.-'*%/"-$+,"-$U,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,CCorrespondence with TV presenter Nick
OL,4,COwen
OL,5,
OL,6,GRE ROYAL PREMIERES ` ANY THAT
OL,7,GPARTICULARLY STOOD OUT? AND ANY FILM
OL,8,GSTARS YOU ENJOYED MEETING?
OL,10,F"As for Royal premieres, these happened
OL,11,Ffor me during my time as ITV Sport's
OL,12,Fmain presenter, from 1986 to 1992.
OL,14,F"Premieres were part of the sport/OB
OL,15,Fbrief. They also did Wish You Were
OL,16,FHere..?, so I worked for the programme
OL,17,Fcountless times too, travelling the
OL,18,Fworld.
OL,23,EPub: 10-Jan-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BShowreel  CRewind FNat Radio
FL,146,140,120,200,0,100
PN,14516
SC,0016
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F145A1786056662
OL,1,W~s1z5~k4j5jw=hw1~sj5          G16/21
OL,2,W,.!/*%+.!+.-'*%/"-$+,"-$U,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,CCorrespondence with TV presenter Nick
OL,4,COwen
OL,5,
OL,6,F"As for stars I met, it was quite a
OL,7,Fthrill to meet Shirley MacLaine. Also,
OL,8,FTim Dalton when he was playing Bond. I
OL,9,Fwent on the Bond set.
OL,11,F"What particularly stands out is
OL,12,Fgetting to know Princess Diana at this
OL,13,Ftime. I worked with her quite a lot at
OL,14,Fcharity events, met her at social
OL,15,Fevents and, of course, saw her at the
OL,16,FRoyal Premieres."
OL,23,EPub: 10-Jan-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BShowreel  CRewind FNat Radio
FL,146,140,120,200,0,100
PN,14517
SC,0017
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F145A1786056662
OL,1,W~s1z5~k4j5jw=hw1~sj5          G17/21
OL,2,W,.!/*%+.!+.-'*%/"-$+,"-$U,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,CCorrespondence with TV presenter Nick
OL,4,COwen
OL,5,
OL,6,GWAS IT A TOUGH DECISION TO LEAVE ITV
OL,7,GFOR THE BBC IN 1992? WAS IT MADE
OL,8,GEASIER THAT IT WAS AGAIN WORKING WITH
OL,9,GANNE?
OL,11,F"Not a tough decision to leave ITV in
OL,12,F1992 at all.
OL,14,F"Thames TV, which was my base, had lost
OL,15,Fits franchise, the future was bit
OL,16,Funcertain and I suddenly got an offer
OL,17,Fto work with Anne again. Perfect
OL,18,Ftiming.
OL,20,F"It was terrific to team up again and I
OL,21,Floved doing those 600 programmes
OL,22,Ftogether at Pebble Mill.
OL,23,EPub: 10-Jan-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BShowreel  CRewind FNat Radio
FL,146,140,120,200,0,100
PN,14518
SC,0018
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F145A1786056662
OL,1,W~s1z5~k4j5jw=hw1~sj5          G18/21
OL,2,W,.!/*%+.!+.-'*%/"-$+,"-$U,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,CCorrespondence with TV presenter Nick
OL,4,COwen
OL,5,
OL,6,F"By the by, Anne and I had stood in for
OL,7,FRichard and Judy in the late eighties
OL,8,Fat the Albert Dock, when they were on
OL,9,Fholiday.
OL,11,F"Our ratings were mostly neck and neck
OL,12,Fwith ITV, but the powers that be at the
OL,13,FBBC decided the shows were too similar,
OL,14,Fso they took ours off air.
OL,16,F"For the next year-and-a-half, I
OL,17,Fpresented loads of different shows up
OL,18,Fand down the country for different
OL,19,Fregions.
OL,23,EPub: 10-Jan-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BShowreel  CRewind FNat Radio
FL,146,140,120,200,0,100
PN,14519
SC,0019
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F145A1786056662
OL,1,W~s1z5~k4j5jw=hw1~sj5          G19/21
OL,2,W,.!/*%+.!+.-'*%/"-$+,"-$U,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,CCorrespondence with TV presenter Nick
OL,4,COwen
OL,5,
OL,6,GHOW DID THE JOB OFFER COME ABOUT FOR
OL,7,GMIDLANDS TODAY AND WHAT WAS IT LIKE
OL,8,GRETURNING TO REGIONAL NEWS AFTER 14
OL,9,GYEARS?
OL,11,F"I was approached in the summer of 1997
OL,12,Fto cover for holidays at Midlands
OL,13,FToday, which came from Pebble Mill.
OL,15,F"I did that for two weeks and then a
OL,16,Fjob offer followed. A one or two-year
OL,17,Fcontract. I started on 6th October,
OL,18,F1997.
OL,20,F"I settled in very quickly and
OL,21,Fthoroughly enjoyed it.
OL,23,EPub: 10-Jan-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BShowreel  CRewind FNat Radio
FL,146,140,120,200,0,100
PN,14520
SC,0020
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F145A1786056662
OL,1,W~s1z5~k4j5jw=hw1~sj5          G20/21
OL,2,W,.!/*%+.!+.-'*%/"-$+,"-$U,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,CCorrespondence with TV presenter Nick
OL,4,COwen
OL,5,
OL,6,F"As you know, regional TV is a very
OL,7,Fimportant part of the BBC output. Quite
OL,8,Foften ` in fact more often than not `
OL,9,Fthat half hour between 6.30pm and 7pm
OL,10,Fis the most watched TV on the whole of
OL,11,FBritish TV, beating all the soaps.
OL,13,F"It's like jigsaw of all the regions
OL,14,Fadded together. Half a million here,
OL,15,Fhalf a million there."
OL,23,EPub: 10-Jan-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BShowreel  CRewind FNat Radio
FL,146,140,120,200,0,100
PN,14521
SC,0021
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F145A1786056662
OL,1,W~s1z5~k4j5jw=hw1~sj5          G21/21
OL,2,W,.!/*%+.!+.-'*%/"-$+,"-$U,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,CCorrespondence with TV presenter Nick
OL,4,COwen
OL,5,
OL,6,GFINALLY, DID VIEWERS EVER CONFUSE YOU
OL,7,GWITH NICHOLAS OWEN OF ITN?
